==============================================================================================================================
A.  INDEPENDENT RECOMPUTATION OF THE RUNG -- analytic deep-MOND, no Jeans integration, no external field
==============================================================================================================================
  g06's own check J3 establishes that in the deep-MOND field of a POINT mass the tracer dispersion obeys
      3 sigma^2 = sqrt(G M a_0)   for ANY tracer profile.
  These groups run at x_int ~ 1e-4 - 2e-2 a_0 and e_N/x_int ~ 0.06, so they ARE in that limit and the host
  carries 93% of the light.  So the whole Jeans apparatus is optional and the boost can be recomputed as
      boost = sigma_obs^2 / sigma_pred^2,   sigma_pred = (G M_b a_0)^(1/4)/sqrt(3).
  If this does not land on g06's 0.817 the audit has nothing to attack.
  rebuilt independently: 26 groups, 333 members, D = 0.01 - 10.70 Mpc
  [PASS] A1 the sample rebuild reproduces g06's sample exactly (26 groups, 333 members).  If it does not, everything below is about a different sample and the audit is void   (26 groups, 333 members against g06's 26 / 333)
