    NGC3521          5   10.70   0.00384     53.2    112.8    0.22    0.23
    NGC4631          5    7.38   0.00144    184.8     85.6    4.66    6.01
    NGC5055          5    8.99   0.00272     77.4    106.7    0.53    0.60
